{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.61:1.3", "PA_thag_1.61:1.4"], "en": "\"Not seeing what is not seen, one does not see what is seen. ...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.61:1.5"], "en": "[Thus spoke] the Elder Vappa.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
